## Convert to long format

To convert the data to long format, you can use the Polars method `unpivot`, which is the opposite of `pivot`, like this:

::: {#b841bf40 .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .unpivot(index='Item',
          variable_name='Day',
          value_name='Units')
 )
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=2}
```{=html}
